graph LR
    Router[llm-d-router<br/>EPP / pd-sidecar / coordinator]

    %% External Dependencies
    Router -->|ext-proc protocol| GoControlPlane["envoyproxy go-control-plane v1.37.0"]
    Router -->|gRPC server| GRPC["grpc-go v1.84.0"]
    Router -->|manager, caches, metrics auth| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.2"]
    Router -->|k8s clients| ClientGo["client-go v0.37.2"]
    Router -->|Gateway API types| GatewayAPI["gateway-api v1.6.3"]
    Router -->|metrics| PromClient["prometheus client_golang v1.24.1"]
    Router -->|tracing| OTelLib["OpenTelemetry v1.46.0"]
    Router -->|OpenAI types| OpenAIGo["openai-go v1.12.0"]
    Router -->|plugin expressions| CEL["cel-go v0.29.2"]
    Router -.->|optional KV events, Mooncake| ZMQ["go-zeromq zmq4 v0.17.0"]
    Router -.->|optional async / KV index| GoRedis["go-redis v9.22.0"]
    Router -.->|optional GKE/Vertex| AIPlatform["cloud.google.com aiplatform"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    Router -->|InferencePool CRD + EPP protocol| GIE["gateway-api-inference-extension v1.6.2"]
    Router -.->|async request queuing| LLMDAsync["llm-d-async v1.0.0"]
    Router -->|metrics scrape, ZMQ, HTTP proxy| ModelServers["vLLM / SGLang model servers"]
    Router -.->|predicted latency scoring| LatencyPredictor["llm-d latency predictor"]

    %% Integration Points
    Gateway["Gateway API impl.<br/>Istio / OSSM / AgentGateway / Envoy v1.40.2"] -->|ext-proc 9002/TCP| Router
    KServe["KServe LLMInferenceService"] -.->|deploys inferred| Router
    Prometheus["Prometheus / ServiceMonitor"] -->|scrape 9090/TCP| Router

    %% External Services
    Router -->|watches, leases, TokenReview/SAR| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API]
    Router -.->|async broker 6379/TCP| Redis[Redis]
    Router -.->|OTLP 4317/TCP| OTelCol[OpenTelemetry Collector]

